            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Control the finished size of your shawl by adjusting the number of needles used. <br>\r\n<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Want a scarf? Reduce the number of needles and check the <b>H</b><small><em> (Height)</em></small> and <b>W</b><small><em> (Width)</em></small> dimensions",
