      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "Even though you are knitting a scarf or shawl, it's important to swatch in your stitch pattern.<br>\r\nMeasuring accurate gauge and dressing your swatch will ensure:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>You will have enough yarn</li>\r\n<li>You will know the finished size</li>\r\n<li>You will know how the yarn washes (stretches, bleeds, shrinks, felts etc)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 5615,
              "order": 1
            },
            {
